  "prefLabel": "Mil 202.01 Commencement of Hearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mil 202.01 Commencement of Hearing. A hearing shall be commenced by an order of the department giving notice to the parties as required in RSA 184:87, RSA 184:91, RSA 184:90-a, and He-P 2705.01(c).\n\nSource. #7529, eff 7-12-01",
